@startuml DataAccessLayerPackages

title Financial Position Report Generator - Data Access Layer Packages
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "asset_report.data_access" as DataAccess #FFF0DA {
  [__init__.py] as DataAccessAPI
  [json_repository.py] as JSONRepositoryModule
  DataAccessAPI ..> JSONRepositoryModule : re-exports
}

package "asset_report.domain" as Domain #E3F0F8 {
  [models.py] as ModelsModule
  [repositories.py] as RepositoriesModule
}

JSONRepositoryModule ..> ModelsModule : constructs domain objects
JSONRepositoryModule ..> RepositoriesModule : structural implementation

note bottom of DataAccess
  json_repository.py contains the complete
  read -> standardize -> validate -> map pipeline.
  Both asset and liability sections use the same pipeline.
  Single snapshots and ordered period arrays are auto-detected.

  JSONFinancialStatementRepository satisfies the
  repository protocol by structural typing.

  Paired class diagram:
  05_data_access_layer_classes.puml
end note

@enduml
